{{also|Drunk}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|drunke}}, {{m|enm|drunken}}, {{m|enm|ydrunke}}, {{m|enm|ydrunken}}, from {{inh|en|ang|druncen}}, {{m|ang|ġedruncen||drunk}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*drunkanaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*gadrunkanaz||drunk; drunken}}, past participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*drinkaną||to drink}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|dronken}}, {{cog|fy|dronken}}, {{cog|nl|dronken}}, {{m|nl|gedronken}}, {{cog|nds-de|drunken}}, {{m|nds-de|bedrunken}}, {{cog|de|trunken}},
{{m|de|getrunken}}, {{m|de|betrunken}}, {{cog|sv|drucken}}, {{cog|is|drukkinn}}.

